{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"This is a major port of call for airships to dock and land.  The tallest and largest building in Hampstead is placed atop a large hill, and is full of towers with landing pads and docks for ships to park.  This is also the cleanest and most well kept part of Hampstead, with pristine white stonework and large mosaic stained glass.  Walkways interconnect many towers, and a single long stair leads down to the streets.  Currently the British are heavily restricting air traffic, and occupying the port.","created_at":"2021-06-06T20:31:10.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"851196545079574569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
