{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"It takes Roy a moment to notice. \"Oh, hi. You were here during that pickle with the guards, right? Good to see you're doing fine.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:14:12.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864026846206754826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"You must have me confused with some other, more handsome and daring Tatankan.\" Apgan takes out the wanted poster with the 1000 gold reward for his head. \"That Tatankan has symmetrical horns and wears traditional Tatankan clothing, unlike me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:16:01.064000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864027299552821268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"(You notice that Apgan's clothes and horns have changed since last night.)","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:16:17.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864027367209959434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Yeah, we were both here at the docks watching it all unfold, I suppose. I was concerned the guards would think we were involved.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:18:42.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864027978325426176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Well seeing as how neither of us are on this poster, we must be safe.\" Apgan nods, agreeing with himself.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:19:43.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864028233623273472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"A vaguely familiar lady approaches from the distance, with a cloak around her face as a mask. Behind her, a very familiar four-winged raven flies.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:20:42.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864028479615402024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"(she also has different clothing and her scars/markings are concealed by disguise kit)","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:21:03.523000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T06:21:08.220000Z","id":"864028568157290536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Hopefully. But with that damned curfew, not sure if anyone can really be safe, I suppose. Before it I'd find quite a few late night repair jobs around the port to keep me from eating my own airship. But now, you know, maybe the wood could be nutritious.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:21:22.618000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864028648247918603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Greetings *stranger*!\" Apgan grins at his use of the word \"stranger\" in reference to Sabrine.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:21:58.289000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T06:23:55.804000Z","id":"864028797862543371","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Oh, hello. I haven't seen you around here either. I suppose?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:22:26.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864028916716011521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Good man.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:22:41.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864028979328319488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"she nods. 'I happen to be new to the area. This friendly raven decided to follow me around.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:22:53.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029029287985172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"(I don't know if I can telepathy to two people at once so if not I'm just telling them in quick succession)\n||Not that the Redcoats saw Kukudh.|| she then continues telepathically to the two of them.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:23:27.618000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029172534738974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Are you sure it's not a weird pigeon? Not anything wrong with your companion there, just that there've been quite a few pigeons around here lately, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:23:58.417000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029301716156426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I've noticed that too. Three of them slept on my bed last night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:24:36.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029460302659624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"she makes a strange noise, with a lot of movement from where her mouth is concealed. 'Those thrice-cursed pigeons. One of them gave me the most awful sensory overload yesterday, causing me to make some unwise decisions. After I offered it free room and board, too...'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:25:18.293000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029636739727363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Have you heard of the pigeon lords?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:25:20.353000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029645380649030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I don't know precise details, but in the noir, there are those with control of the pigeons, called the pigeon lords. I don't know much more than that, but they have strange powers.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:26:16.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029880080924713","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Not really, only heard of swarmkeepers back where I'm from. By the sound of it, it could be like a swarmkeeper, but of pigeons, I suppose?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:26:20.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864029897152004105","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'I have not heard of either. Only those guided by a singular being.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:26:51.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030027225104405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'Be it a deity, a demon, a spirit like Kukudh... Guidance comes in many forms.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:27:10.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030108867625000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I could sure use some guidance that can see farther than a foot forwards, I suppose...\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:28:29.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030436706746388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Beware those who can see much further than you can, yet heed them all the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:29:01.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030574037434379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"Kukudh caws ominously, before saying in Sabrine's voice, 'They say they offer you their guidance if we happen to be together, fellow strangers looking to shed the cloak of blood.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:30:13.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030875234074644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Oh, I meant literally. These guys can do a few things, but finding me things to do is not among them.\" A few bugs crawl out of his sleeve onto his hand.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:30:34.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030964882997289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Hahaha ho, you are a strange one!\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:31:00.164000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864031070650236948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"her attention snaps to the bugs. 'These are your esteemed guides? Fascinating creatures.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:31:11.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864031119014887424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"absentmindedly, she tries to telepathically talk to the bugs, but targets Roy with the message instead; ||You know, I expected bugs like you to be flocking around me by now. I guess Kukudh wards them off? I'll tell them not to eat you though, don't worry.||","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:33:55.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864031805078634516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Sort of. I feed and shelter them, they help me in some ways. It's a lifetime deal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:34:47.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864032023785504811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
