{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"Roy's confused, and looks at Sabrine. \"Were you talking to me now with something about your raven eating me, or am I going crazy from boredom?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:36:06.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864032356176494592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"she gasps involuntarily, a lot of movement under her mask, before regaining composure and speaking through Kukudh, 'Ah! I apologise, I was trying to speak with your bugs.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:37:03.015000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864032592557506610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
