{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"You won't get much out of any individual of them. They are bugs, after all. It's just in a large group, and with a keeper, that some sort of a mind appears. Though mostly just for working with their keeper, not outside. And you're right, it's good protein. Just give them some mistletoe and they'll produce food that can last you a whole day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:39:48.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864033284810735626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
