{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'Fascinating. Such small creatures, creating such a large amount of food.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:41:57.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864033825763754004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Yeah, it's something just like those, I suppose. Just that my bugs make them.\"\n(the image of goodberry equivalent being somehow produced by bugs through some indeterminate magi-biological means is precisely why I took that spell)","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:42:22.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864033932336300081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"(it works for royal jelly without magic, so with magic other bugs can make similar stuff right)","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:42:55.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864034070522495008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Oh, it's not a giant feast or anything. Just the same size as the berries the gentleman here mentions. Just that one fills you for a day. I'd make some, if my pouch with stuff wasn't taken from me along with the rest of my things.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:43:55.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864034322129485860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"(oh, also almost forgot, Apgan looks a grayish yellow instead of his usual orange and red coloration)","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:45:47.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864034792559345684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'Yours too? I require a focus in order to truly use my mental abilities, but I was unable to slip it past those with blood on their backs. All I can do without them is certain abilities that happen to be similar to what a stranger showed off yesterday, as well as basic magical practise.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:46:54.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864035072663486517","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"Apgan nods solemnly.","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:49:00.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864035603808780310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I had a really nice longbow I made back at home. Not having it with me is really bringing me down, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:53:56.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864036843941920799","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'In theory, if we were able to locate the materials, would you be able to make another?'","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:55:08.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864037144464457749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"There's money to be made all over the city, if you're willing to brave the dangers. Could just buy another.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:55:24.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864037213104766996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I don't know if I still could make one. That was before I found my place to be around machines. That's what I was hoping to do, but apparently at this time of the day nobody runs these ports anymore to check with to see if they have something to do. It's a surprise even guards are around, I suppose, but they probably have nothing better to do than keeping people out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:57:17.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864037686116352040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"From one day to another, the city gets really unfriendly to those who sleep through daylight.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:58:04.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864037884302196746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I could buy you guys some passes, if you think you could make use of them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:59:22.763000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864038211869343764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I appreciate, but I feel like if I can't through this myself, I'll end up right back where I started were generosity to run out, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:01:15.404000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864038684319416340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"she nods. 'With my... condition, the bright light of day is a detriment to me.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:02:40.426000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039040927793173","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Oh, you'd owe me the gold, but I could make the purchase, if you won't be awake to make the purchase yourself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:02:43.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039054521008148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'How would you do that without us being there?'","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:03:26.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039233801682944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Aren't these passes ridiculously expensive, though?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:03:34.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039269256527883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I've done well for myself in the past two days.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:03:55.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039355625635862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"If I found a job that needed a few extra hands, a night job, I could see helping you two out being worth my while.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:04:47.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864039572584005642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"With my skills though, if I can't find any work around the port, with all the machinery around, I don't know if I'd find anything outside to pay back a debt like that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:06:50.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040089222905867","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Violence pays well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:07:08.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040164535173160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Risking your life pays well in this city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:07:27.417000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040244654112778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"There is risking your life, and there's just throwing it away. An archer without his bow can't do much violence anyway.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:08:25.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040487337197568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"How are you with tossing daggers?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:09:00.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040634839203861","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Not something I've had to try before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:09:29.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864040758243491850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Look, if I find a job, I'm willing to make an investment in you. Component pouch, longbow, whatever you need. I just need to know you'll be able to live up to your end of the bargain.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:10:57.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864041124032675881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"And that's a big if, my friend.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:11:31.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864041270435643422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"No promises.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:11:46.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864041331943669791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I could fell quite a few beasts with one, that I can give my word for. If there's one thing the swarm can do, it's bringing prey to the colony.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:15:02.111000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864042151779631115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"Sabrine looks around, before Kukudh flies closer to the others and whispers, 'I happened to manage to sneak in a shortsword, if that would be any use. I mostly used it for cutting materials in the wilderness.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:16:46.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864042587639119892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"To be honest, I was already planning to just try to take a mad dash through the fog to try to get out if I couldn't find anything here. And if they jail me, whatever, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:17:43.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864042830225080320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'I don't personally need it, but I would be willing to offer it to the cause.'","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:17:44.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864042831530295327","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"Hmm. Now that you mention it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:19:01.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864043156257636362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"'I would just need a promise that I understand may be difficult to keep...'","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:20:29.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864043524911267890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"Apgan looks on intently.","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:21:02.369000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864043662811463700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
