{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851195659985485844","content":"\"I think it would not. And well, I'm not as good with a sword as I'd be with a bow, but...\" Roy reaches to his hood behind his back and pulls out a hilt of a shortsword before putting it back under his clothes. \"Maybe with two I could make up for it, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T07:27:37.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864045319133855784","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
